; cli-integration-cram: dune cram tests for the mathc CLI.
; Each .t file in tests/cram/ is a file-style cram test. The (deps)
; below triggers a build of bin/mathc.exe before the cram tests run,
; so the tests can invoke the binary by absolute path inside the
; cram sandbox (which does not expose the build dir via relative
; paths; see OCAML_BEST_PRACTICES trap log entry §11.20 for the
; cram-sandbox vs binary-path resolution).

(cram
 (deps validate.t assess.t attest.t ../bin/mathc.exe))
